      - lia.
      - exact B64.
      - clear - Q12. Z.div_mod_to_equations. lia.
      - exact (proj1 (stk_split asegs m (wa_lo w) (wa_s1 w + 672) (wa_sp0 w) (xa_stk _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ X0) ltac:(lia))).
      - exact S1.
      - unfold ANT_STACK, AOPNEW_STACK, AMALLOC_STACK, APM_STACK in *. lia.
      - exact ERR.
      - exact (xa_meminv _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ X0).
      - exact (wk_tp H w OK).
      - exact (xa_aconst _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ X0).
      - exact (xa_rfs _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ X0).
      - exact (xa_stack0 _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ X0).
      - lia.
      - exact OWNm. }
    intros [ms1 mo1] POST.
    destruct POST as (ra' & t0' & t1' & t2' & a0' & a1' & a2' & a3' & a4' & a5' & a6' & a7' & s2' & s5' & s6' & s8' & s9'
                      & t3' & t4' & t5' & t6' & m1 & errv1 & s1 & LB' & LBm' & F' & fc' & p & bl' & bc' & ents' & inserted & rehashed
                      & j584 & j592 & j600 & j608 & j632 & j640 & j656 & j664 & POST).
    destruct POST as (VIS1 & FRZ1 & KR1 & MP1 & MI1 & ST1 & ER1 & RA1 & U1 & SH1 & AD1 & WR1 & Hin & NINS & INS & NRH & RHD
                      & RH1 & PE1 & PM1 & OW1 & XP1 & CJ1 & CJ2 & CJ3 & RF1 & AC1' & S01 & AL1).
